content:
{
 "queue": "hr",
 "summary": "Tara Singh (E035, Data Analyst, Operations) asks how many bereavement days she is entitled to after the death of her grandfather on Saturday 2026-11-14, and whether she must use PTO for it. Funeral is in Dayton on Tuesday 2026-11-24. I checked POL-PTO-01, POL-SICK-01 and POL-OFF-02; none covers bereavement leave. Please confirm the bereavement entitlement and whether it is paid separately from PTO, and contact the employee."
}

{
 "kind": "escalated",
 "message": "I'm very sorry about your grandfather, Tara. Thank you for telling us.\n\nI checked our leave policies (annual PTO, sick leave, and leaves of absence), and none of them sets out bereavement days. So I can't tell you how many bereavement days you get or whether they're separate from PTO. I've sent your question to the HR team (ticket ESC-1001) and asked them to contact you directly.\n\nIn the meantime, please don't worry about the funeral next week. If you need time off for it, you can book it in the HR portal. Absences of 3 or more consecutive working days need 2 weeks' notice under the PTO policy, so you may want to raise this with HR or your manager as soon as you can.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-PTO-01",
  "POL-SICK-01",
  "POL-OFF-02"
 ]
}
